1303 0 obj
  << /ActualText (ecoATM has kept over 50 million phones out of landfills since 2009 through our network of 7\054500\053 kiosks that buy \046 recycle secondhand devices\056 At ecoATM I am responsible for end\055to\055end experiences for both ecoatm\056com \046 our ecoATM mobile app\056\nDesign Expertise \046 Selected Impact\nLarge scale redesign of ecoATM\031s mobile app\056 Introduced new Price Your Device widget\054 removed friction causing flows\054 and  increased drop\055off code generation by 25\045 on iOS \046 13\045 on Android \050Mobile App\054 2026\051\nRedesigned ecoatm\056com\031s Price Your Device widget\054 increasing over\055all drop\055off code generation by 2\05618\045 and driving \0441\0566M in annual margin increase \050Web\054 2025\051\nMaintained organization wide design libraries for web\054 mobile app\054 and kiosk components\nAI Workflows\nConducted usability study on Device Prep using Figma Make prototypes\056 Our AI prototype helped us test a larger variety user paths \046 avoided dead\055ends typical in Figma prototypes\056\nModernized our Personas created in 2022 using Claude to analyze data collected from user surveys\056 This helps us continue to refine our understanding of the 2026 ecoATM user\056 \nImplemented customer facing landing pages using Claude Code\054 allowing us to ship without having to involve front\055end developers\056\nTurned designs on Figma into UI tickets complete with requirements \046 acceptance criteria using ChatGPT\054 saving our product managers valuable time)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 1304 0 R
     /Pg 1281 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

